Bind Npc 24203 Zone 1 for karus mage
Bind Npc 14203 Zone 2 for elmorad mage
Quest 336 "70Lv skill"
    Journal for karus "I decided to undergo the test to learn hidden skills from [Archmage] Drake."
    Journal for elmorad "I decided to undergo the test to learn hidden skills from [Archmage] Drake."
    Collect 5 of 810369000

Requires player level >= 70

Rewards none

On offer
    Say "Magic is the greatest ability created by man. You are well qualified to employ the ultimate magic. Is it time for another archmage to come on board..."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "To complete the ultimate mage spell, you will need 5 [Spell Stone Powder]. Are you ready for this?"

On in_progress
    Say "To complete the ultimate mage spell, you need 5 [Spell Stone Powder]."

On ready
    Say "Master, all the items needed to complete ultimate magic employed by archmages have been acquired. Let's hurry back to [Archmage] Drake."
    Topic "Confirm" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "You now possess ultimate magic. With two different magic for each element, your powers will be incomparable and unprecedented. You have nothing more to wish for as a mage."
